          <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg mb-8 max-w-3xl">Hamburg is the only major German city in which up to three authorities can be competent for a container laboratory: the relevant borough office under the Hamburg Building Code (HBauO), the Hamburg Port Authority on port land, and BUKEA for BSL-3. We communicate with all three — you do not.</p>
